      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CALL-ZCL0255P-001.
               EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('ZCL0255P')
                         COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                         LENGTH(WS-CALEN)
                         RESP(WS-RESP)
               END-EXEC.
